    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE MEMBER OF THE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      229.53,
      359.05,
      408.08,
      370.12
    ],
    "text": "HAMBANTOTA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      187.53,
      374.17,
      414.05,
      400.12
    ],
    "text": "UNDER SECTION 65A(2) OF THELOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      137.85,
      404.17,
      463.98,
      430.12
    ],
    "text": "(CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BYLOCAL AUTHORITIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No. 30 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      441.37,
      518.54,
      452.44
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of a member in Hambantota Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      462.97,
      546.64,
      511.48
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the recognized political party namely United National Party, to which the formermember, Ayub Khan belonged, was required by me under Section 65A(2) of the aforesaid Ordinance, to nominate within aperiod of of thirty (30) days a person eligible under the Ordinance for election as a member of that Hambantota MunicipalCouncil who shall be declared elected as a member ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      522.01,
      546.39,
      545.56
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has nominated Mr. Baba Juhara Cassimbeing an eligible person under the aforesaid Ordinance to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      556.09,
      546.65,
      604.6
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Udaha Dasilige Deepal Darshana Chandrarathna, Returning Officer of Hambantota MunicipalCouncil, acting in terms of Section 65A(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance as amended by filling of Vacancies inLocal authorities (Special Provisions) Act, No. 30 of 2013 (Chapter 262) do hereby declare Mr. Baba Juhara Cassim elected asa member of the Hambantota Municipal Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      429.69,
      627.37,
      528.67,
      638.44
    ],
    "text": "DEEPAL CHANDRARATHNA,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
